==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈstɛəs/}}
** {{rhymes|ɛə(r)s}}
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|/ˈstɛrs/}}
* {{audio|en-us-stairs.ogg|Audio (US)}}
** {{rhymes|ɛə(r)z}}

Note: The GA pronunciation is homophonous with ''stares'', while the RP is not; RP ''stairs'' is a rhyme for ''scarce''.

===Noun===
{{head|en|noun}}

# {{plurale tantum}} a contiguous set of [[step]]s connecting two [[floor]]s
# {{plural of|stair}}

